   Hmmm.. according to Google Correlate (and thanks to James Riley for
pointing out this fun little toy), the search pattern "lojban" is very
similar to that for "littlest pet shop target" (r=.7448), "fisher price
kids" (r=.6651) and "vtech smartville" (r=.6167) (see
http://correlate.googlelabs.com/search?e=lojban&t=weekly# )  Apparently,
we've been marketing to to the wrong crowd.  WE should be going after
preschoolers.  (Yeah, yeah, I know, it's really because the xkcd cartoon
about lojban appeared during teh xams shopping season, but still, it's kinda
funny)

         --gejyspa

